# 012-lighthouse-ttfb — Lighthouse のサーバ応答時間は 103 で何を返すか
base=http://localhost:8086 think_ms=200 cache_control=no-store samples=3

## 103 を送らない（対照）
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=none&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=217ms first-contentful-paint=1072ms largest-contentful-paint=1222ms
   #2 server-response-time=210ms first-contentful-paint=1057ms largest-contentful-paint=1207ms
   #3 server-response-time=207ms first-contentful-paint=1065ms largest-contentful-paint=1215ms

## 103 で実際に使う資源を先読みさせる
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=preload&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=2ms first-contentful-paint=1058ms largest-contentful-paint=1208ms
   #2 server-response-time=2ms first-contentful-paint=1076ms largest-contentful-paint=1226ms
   #3 server-response-time=2ms first-contentful-paint=1067ms largest-contentful-paint=1217ms

server-response-time: 210ms（103 なし）→ 2ms（103 あり）
server-response-time は 103 で落ちるか: YES
largest-contentful-paint: 1215ms → 1217ms
画面の指標も動いたか: no
103 でレポートが壊れるか: no
